esting. The final step is the prediction, which tells us if it is a success ( when there is a match between the image captured and the images in the database) or a failure ( when there is no match between the image captured and the images in the database).","topics":[],"score":287410,"global_rank":27628,"on_pypi":false,"top_pypi":false,"python_rank":5760},{"name":"nick-terry/Splitting-GP","owner":"nick-terry","html_url":"https://github.com/nick-terry/Splitting-GP","stars":4,"forks":0,"watchers":2,"issues":0,"language":"Python","description":"Implementation and experiments for the Splitting GP model","topics":[],"score":287397,"global_rank":27637,"on_pypi":false,"top_pypi":false,"python_rank":5761},{"name":"zaro0508/sceptre-identity-resolver","owner":"zaro0508","html_url":"https://github.com/zaro0508/sceptre-identity-resolver","stars":4,"forks":1,"watchers":1,"issues":1,"language":"Python","description":"A set of Sceptre resolvers to help identify a stack","topics":[],"score":287396,"global_rank":27639,"on_pypi":false,"top_pypi":false,"python_rank":5762},{"name":"renysaldivar/Charms","owner":"renysaldivar","html_url":"https://github.com/renysaldivar/Charms","stars":3,"forks":1,"watchers":2,"issues":0,"language":"Python","description":null,"topics":[],"score":287386,"global_rank":27641,"on_pypi":false,"top_pypi":false,"python_rank":5763},{"name":"ProjectSidewalk/sidewalk-ai-api","owner":"ProjectSidewalk","html_url":"https://github.com/ProjectSidewalk/sidewalk-ai-api","stars":2,"forks":0,"watchers":2,"issues":4,"language":"Python","description":"This serves as an API implementation of the Project Sidewalk AI models for tagging and validating labels.","topics":[],"score":287367,"global_rank":27651,"on_pypi":false,"top_pypi":false,"python_rank":5764},{"name":"robert-godlewski/reddit_clone","owner":"robert-godlewski","html_url":"https://github.com/robert-godlewski/reddit_clone","stars":4,"forks":0,"watchers":3,"issues":1,"language":"Python","description":null,"topics":["f